## Error semantics

| Code | Exit | Meaning |
|---|---|---|
| `INPUT_NOT_FOUND` | 2 | The input file does not exist |
| `INPUT_NOT_JSON` | 2 | The input is not strict UTF-8 JSON |
| `INPUT_SCHEMA_INVALID` | 2 | The input does not satisfy the contract |
| `SCHEMA_NOT_FOUND` | 2 | The contract is not vendored in `assets/schemas/` |

